  "passage": "Price change for Nvidia stock in last 1 year: 24%\n$NVDA Stock Price as of Jul. 9: $203\n52-Week High: $236\n$NVDA Stock Price Target: $302\nTD Cowen reiterated its Buy rating on Nvidia ( NVDA ) stock and named it a Top Pick, maintaining a $275 price target implying roughly 35% upside from where shares closed.\nThe call came after the firm hosted an investor lunch with Nvidia’s leadership team, including CEO Jensen Huang, CFO Colette Kress, and Head of Investor Relations Toshiya Hari.\nAnalyst Joshua Buchalter said Nvidia’s message to investors is clear: computing power remains in short supply, and the market is thinking about Nvidia’s technology far too narrowly.\nHe pointed out that Nvidia’s hardware and software work together, or “co-design,” in a way that gives the company a real edge as AI keeps evolving from general chatbot-style applications toward more specialized, industry-specific tools.\nTo put some numbers behind that, Nvidia estimates about 20% of its business c…",
